flowchart TD
  A[SQL transaction] --> B[Authorization context]
  B --> C[Committed PostgreSQL transaction]
  C --> D[Raw change record]
  D --> E[Canonical binary bytes]
  E --> F[SHA-256 change hash]
  F --> G[Previous hash link]
  G --> H[Immutable log]
  H --> I[Version]
  I --> J[State leaf hash]
  J --> K[Merkle tree]
  K --> L[Checkpoint]
  L --> M[External anchor - optional]
